========================================
  KEY TAKEAWAYS
========================================
1. Avoid divisions in hot loops
2. Use powers of 2 when possible
3. Access memory sequentially (cache)
4. Reuse values to minimize checks
5. Precalculate constants
6. Unroll loops for fewer branches
